+ * What the time budget costs the page (VitaSurf).
+ *
+ * A GitHub load spent 20458 ms in 59 promise jobs and one of them was
+ * stopped by the budget after 6817 ms -- six and a half seconds of work
+ * thrown away, and the page never finished building itself. Count the
+ * jobs the budget stops apart from the ones that raise on their own,
+ * and say how long the busiest drain was and how many jobs it ran, so
+ * a ceiling can be set from figures rather than from a guess.
+ */
+extern unsigned int vitasurf_js_jobs_budget;
+extern unsigned int vitasurf_ms_js_jobs_budget;
